<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Edison Int'l upped to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Edison Int'l upped to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said on Wednesday it had raised its rating for Edison International to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- The power company's stock opened up 1/8 to 19-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
